  "cta": {"id":"if-he-is-willing-to-talk-to-somebody","eyebrow":"WORK WITH ME","h2":"If he is willing to talk to somebody","text":"He does not need to decide whether this is burnout, anxiety, a career problem or a relationship problem before getting in touch. We can start with what has been happening.","button":{"label":"See what therapy with me is like","href":"/considering-therapy/"},"blocks":[{"t":"p","text":"He does not need to decide whether this is burnout, anxiety, a career problem or a relationship problem before getting in touch. We can start with what has been happening."},{"t":"p","text":"I work mainly with men in tech, startups, business and demanding careers. Before training as a psychotherapist, I spent more than 18 years working in product, growth and technology. That background helps us examine the professional context alongside its effect on the rest of his life."},{"t":"button","label":"See what therapy with me is like","href":"/considering-therapy/"},{"t":"link","label":"Psychotherapy for men in tech & demanding careers","href":"/therapy-for-men-in-tech/"},{"t":"p","text":"If the difficulty is now primarily between the two of you, couples therapy may be a better starting point."},{"t":"link","label":"Couples therapy","href":"/couples-therapy/"}]},
